<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Durco Int'l raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Durco Int'l raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded Durco International Inc to buy from market perform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Durco gained 1-5/16 to 32-1/16.</p>
</text>
